"""Full ORB board scanner. Production REST pages feed bounded per-symbol reducers.

Default scans reuse compact session state, replace the recent correction window and
periodically reconcile from 09:30. ORBS_INCREMENTAL=off uses bounded full replay. Bulk
pages never enter a fallback cache. Explicit stream/research sources keep the legacy
scan_symbol path as the independent comparison oracle. See docs/COST_REDUCTION.md.
"""
